WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.420
So, decided to start running?

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:04.180
Apple Watch decided to start
a few new things too.

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:06.700
It used to measure the distance you ran.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.360
Now it measures stride length.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.780
It tells breaststroke
from backstroke.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:15.660
It tracks temperature changes
to estimate when you ovulated.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:20.500
While you dream, it tracks your REM
sleep down to the minute.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.940
It knows if you've had
a serious car crash.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.360
And calls for help.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.100
Just a few new things.
